<title>USA: Fulton Bancorp completes 1.7 mln shr IPO.</title>
<headline>Fulton Bancorp completes 1.7 mln shr IPO.</headline>
<dateline>FULTON, Mo. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fulton Bancorp Inc said Friday it completed its initial public offering of 1.7 million shares at $10 a share.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, Fulton Savings Bank's plan of conversion was approved by its voting members at a special meeting, Fulton Bancorp, the proposed holding company, said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 2-7/16 to 12-7/16 on Nasdaq Friday.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
